B.P7=new A.hz("By using our site, you agree to:\n- Provide accurate information when registering or becoming a member.\n- Use respectful language when commenting or submitting content.\n- Not copy, distribute, or republish our content without permission.\n- Refrain from engaging in harmful behavior, including harassment, spam, or posting illegal content.",null)
